\n    <td align=\"center\">\r\n      <img src=\"./img/Tasks.png\" width=\"400\" alt=\"Scheduled tasks\"><br>\r\n      <sub>Scheduled tasks</sub>\r\n    </td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td align=\"center\">\r\n      <img src=\"./img/WSL.png\" width=\"400\" alt=\"WSL installation\"><br>\r\n      <sub>WSL</sub>\r\n    </td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n* Fix and update `ScanRegistryPolicies` to scan all created registry policies to make them visible in `gpedit.msc`\r\n* Update initial checks\r\n* Added `TaskbarPosition` function for Windows 11 to manage taskbar position\r\n* The Wrapper's story has come to end: https://t.me/SophiaNews/5470\r\n  * The Wrapper was removed from the repository and it will stopped working\r\n  * @BenchTweakGaming has opened its [sources](https://github.com/BenchTweakGaming/SophiaScriptWrapper)\r\n* Fixed bugs, typos, and minor fixes\r\n* Update localizations\r\n* Update Readmes\r\n\r\n### Download\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td align=\"center\" colspan=\"2\">Windows 10</td>\r\n    <td align=\"center\" colspan=\"2\">Windows 11</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td align=\"left\">\r\n      <a href=\"https://github.com/farag2/Sophia-Script-for-Windows/releases/download/8.1.0/Sophia.Script.for.Windows.10.v7.1.0.zip\">\r\n        <picture>\r\n          <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://shieldcn.dev/badge/PowerShell%205.1.svg?label=Windows%2010%20x64&amp;variant=outline&amp;size=sm&amp;mode=dark\">\r\n          <img src=\"https://shieldcn.dev/badge/PowerShell%205.1.svg?label=Windows%2010%20x64&amp;variant=outline&amp;size=sm&amp;mode=light\">\r\n        </picture>\r\n      </a>\r\n    </td>\r\n    <td align=\"left\">\r\n      <a href=\"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/ecc11da7632033a8481bf11079b51bbc4f04e028b8ddb617f319d0e7634a2b0b\">\r\n        <picture>\r\n          <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://shieldcn.dev/badge/VirusTotal.svg?logo=virustotal&amp;variant=outline&amp;siz